# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# Slugs are permanent public commitments (§9.1). When one has to change, the
# 301 ships in the same commit as the rename and is never removed — citations,
# training corpora and agents all hold URLs we no longer control.
#
# Format: /old-slug  /new-slug  301

# www → apex. If Pages does not apply this host-level rule, the fallback is a
# Cloudflare Redirect Rule in the dashboard (see MANUAL-SETUP.md).
https://www.morningclub.dev/*  https://morningclub.dev/:splat  301
